    "missing_count": 66,
    "remaining_missing": [
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "0258BB7E4068AEDBD91FF7A7FD09F7D9",
        "source_text": "生日：{0}月{1}日"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "03A4003D4EF0981A066D498FA6D9D60E",
        "source_text": "【被动技能】累计消除36个砂纸元素后随机产生1个巧物箱"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "06BDCD674B4BEF45BD0396864CFA8F6A",
        "source_text": "1. 购买萝卜卜盲盒可随机从8款萝卜主题时装中获取1款，1次可购买1盒或6盒。\r\n2. 萝卜卜盲盒中的时装包含2款隐藏款与6款基础款。其中萝国王、萝王后为隐藏款，萝半仙儿、萝大盗、萝清新、萝侠客、萝诗书、萝丰收为基础款。\r\n3. 购买盲盒后会自动开启，获得基础款或隐藏款时优先获取其中未拥有的款式。购买盲盒获得全部基础款"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "117BAA9D43C83183FA912492D05796B9",
        "source_text": "每周一4点社团活跃度排行结算时，每个类型下排名第1-3名、4-10名、11-30名分别获得钻石徽章、火焰会长、金色徽章。\r\n徽章将会显示在社团名片等相关位置，到下次排行结算时重置。"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "15ABFA4149346BC501AD1F8957644BE1",
        "source_text": "获得 <a href=\"GetSystemItem\" color=\"#{0}\" underline=\"/Game/UI/Textures/Libraries/Frames/T_UI_SpriteLine_Splitline.T_UI_SpriteLine_Splitline\" ucolor=\"#{1}\">{2}×{3}"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "15C3107F4C9B0BB957BC748B8A6855B4",
        "source_text": "【被动技能】每进行25次消除后可增加1点步数"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "219037CD4054AEDE3B51B2B86513589B",
        "source_text": "每周一4点社团活跃度结算时，每个类型下排名前30的社团，社团的管理人员会获得限时头像框。头像框发放根据排行结算时社团中的社长和管理人员名单，需手动领取，可使用至下周一4点。"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "2777FC8B4C5C8838C608CAA845E2F7A1",
        "source_text": "每天<Gold_Basic>凌晨0点到早上8点</>为休息时间，期间作物不会被他人采撷"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "27E1A4D141136B7B3A1FB48A8AC734D1",
        "source_text": "竞技玩法将于2024年1月11日~1月17日，晚上20点~22点开放，敬请关注相关官方活动。"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "2A0D01B042078F26BE04F3B6E6954FB6",
        "source_text": "【主动技能】每进行10次消除后可使用，使用后可选择1格基本元素并将其消除"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "2A145FA2428E278329C3C58C6538A616",
        "source_text": "是否确认解除<span color=\"#FFE398\">{0}</>是你的{1}关系？\r\n解除关系后，双方的亲密关系权益将失效\r\n（重新绑定冷却时间：7天）"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "2CDE2AB745CFBC6F106322AB75CF8D75",
        "source_text": "每月1号 04:00 结算"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "2E4B38F04A5E2E8827C17DB35D5FE81C",
        "source_text": "<span color=\"#ffe398\">刷新规则</>\r\n     灾兽共斗排行榜每3周刷新1次，每次刷新排行榜会重置。\r\n     奖励每周一刷新1次，每次刷新后积分奖励会重置。\r\n\r\n<span color=\"#ffe398\">积分规则</>\r\n     灾兽共斗积分获取分为基础积分和额外积分。基础积分每击败一"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "309144BF4484B64911C769AEAC756C49",
        "source_text": "达成下列任意1组条件解锁"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "31B38EFA433700DC13775DBFCBAB63FA",
        "source_text": "<span color=\"#ffe398\">开放时间</>\r\n  S1赛季\r\n\r\n<span color=\"#ffe398\">玩法目标</>\r\n  击败全部关卡首领\r\n\r\n<span color=\"#ffe398\">暗影试炼·静默之域</> \r\n   【静默之域】中，玩家每次进入玩法时，将随机一组词条进行挑战。\r\n  "
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "323808AE4F098A3CDEB354A9122E6FF1",
        "source_text": "确认使用{0}晶珀兑换1次签到？[br]<span color=\"90D1FF\">晶珀不足时，自动使用璇晶抵扣</>"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "3374B7E746697411A08F3E8E871A10DF",
        "source_text": "装备{0}完成万相附流<span color=\"#{1}\">【{2}】</>"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "34FD8C68445A67C691CFEA85788F235F",
        "source_text": "迷踪获取(波流境界达到2级，完成觉醒任务第三章《星辰觉醒》开放)"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "43917A8B4FA34DE90AFC93B715836C93",
        "source_text": "每周一4点可重新定位荣耀战区"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "454010C741F00D6EDC622E8DAD8FA604",
        "source_text": "【艺术家等级说明】[br]1.完成关卡可获得<ffe398>艺术家经验</>，累计经验可提升艺术家等级[br]2.艺术家等级最高可提升至<ffe398>9级</>[br]3.每次艺术家等级提升后可领取1次等级奖励；奖励内容包括<ffe398>精灵搭档</>和<ffe398>精灵技能</>两种[br]4.每次领取奖励时，"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "4E7D886246CDACFF8850A7B7E0B8D8D1",
        "source_text": "热度值达到1000可获取<img src=\"/Game/UI/Icons/Item/Activity/T_UI_Icon_Item_Activity_Fengyun_Coin.T_UI_Icon_Item_Activity_Fengyun_Coin\"/>100，每日最多可领取3次。"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "58D31DC8436D9DB82BF922878695D242",
        "source_text": "每完成 1 项任务，{0}星级+1。"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "593551FD4935E55DCD9DD48928BCE55A",
        "source_text": "※ 队友阵亡后，可以在商店消耗辉金石进行召回[br]※ 每名队友每场战斗最多可召回1次[br]※ 处于死亡决斗，离线情况下的队友无法被召回"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "5B7448C044792A90350AFDA0E13905C1",
        "source_text": "完成关卡并将艺术家等级提升至Lv.1解锁"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "/Game/Data/DataTables/LocalText/DT_LocalizeText_Composite",
        "guid": "5DA7F5F64CF241851A25A3AA422F33FF",
        "source_text": "<span color=\"#ffe398\">开放时间</>\r\n  S1赛季\r\n\r\n<span color=\"#ffe398\">玩法目标</>\r\n  击败全部关卡首领\r\n\r\n<span color=\"#ffe398\">暗影试炼·静默之域</>\r\n  【静默之域】中，玩家每次进入玩法时，将随机一组词条进行挑战。\r\n  除随"
      }
    ],
